{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations","doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If the computed contrast ratio between two given colors meets the 7:1 requirement"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:15MISOFoundations15MISOWCAG21RatioV9meets7to1Sbvp","title":"meets7to1","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"meets7to1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"meets7to1","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio\/meets7to1"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio\/meets7to1","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations/MISOWCAG21Ratio":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","isActive":true}],"title":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio","kind":"symbol"},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité"}],"url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"link","title":"the following guidelines","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the following guidelines"}],"url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"},"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundati